<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN WOMEN'S WTA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN WOMEN'S WTA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>BOL, Croatia 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $107,500 Croatian Open Women's WTA Tennis Tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) beat Rachel McQuillan (Australia) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Silvija Talaja (Croatia) beat 8-Annabel Elwood (Australia) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Corina Moriariu (U.S.) beat Maja Palaversic (Croatia) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Ana Alcazar (Spain) beat Maja Muric (Croatia) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Sarah Pitkowski (France) beat Maria Jose Gaidano (Argentina) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>7-Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) beat Virgina Ruano Pascual (Spain) 6-2 2-6 7-6</p>
<p>4-Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) beat Laura Pena (Spain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Sandra Kleinova (Czech) beat 3-Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>Kristina Brandi (U.S.) beat Noelle Van Lottum (France) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Joanette Kruger (SAfrica) beat 6-Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) 6-3 3-6 7-6</p>
<p>1-Amanda Koetzer (SAfrica) beat Melanie Schnell (Austria) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Emmanuelle Gagliardi (Switzerland) beat Petra Begerow (Germany) 6-4 5-7 6-3</p>
<p>Marion Maruska (Austria) beat Sandra Dopfer (Austria) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>5-Alexandre Fusai (France) beat Radka Zrubakova (Slovakia) 7-6 0-6 6-1</p>
</text>
